"P2891880919" "The Knives are looking for an Arachnos operative named Moira? I know no one by that name. I'll have to do some digging to find out who they're looking for."
// RandomFameString :
"P3531579529" "I hear {VillainName}'s working for Arbiter Daos these days!"

