// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P397286758" "I've done the research, and I believe I know who the Knives of Artemis were seeking. The woman in question was once known as Moira, but when she joined the ranks of the Fortunata, she took up the name Mnemosyne. I know the Knives of Artemis often resent seeing their members leave the fold; it may well be that they wish revenge against Mnemosyne. Unfortunately, the lady's psychic abilities put her in touch with ancestral memories dating back thousands of years. Quite valuable, as you can imagine. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I do not intend to let Mnemosyne be taken without a fight.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3344614440" "Rescue Mnemosyne"
// SendOffString :
"P584772835" "You will go to the Arachnos base where Mnemosyne is stationed, and extract her for her own safety. We can't be sure that the Knives did not already learn her whereabouts."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3298257893" "I tasked you with the rescue of Mnemosyne, and I expect you to follow through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3558228843" "The inner life of a Fortunata is difficult to speculate on. Does Mnemosyne feel any fear of her erstwhile sisters? It's hard to say."

